  "headline": "God of War analysis: Fatherhood and restraint",
  "description": "A thematic essay on God of War, organized around: Fatherhood and restraint.",
  "articleBody": "Reading God of War through Fatherhood and restraint clarifies what the story consistently protects, and what it is willing to break.\n\nThis is an evergreen structural note, centered on motifs and repeated constructions rather than plot-by-plot recap.\n\n1. Motifs: what repeats, and how its meaning shifts over time.\n\n2. Tensions: where value systems collide and why it matters.\n\n3. Aftertaste: how endings shape the theme’s final form.",
